"""Cybersecurity glossary, part 15: security of and with AI (AI-powered scams, attacks on AI systems, and defences). Protective descriptions only.
fr/rw/sw are drafts for fluent review."""
from cyber_terms_12 import T

TERMS_15 = [
    T("ai-powered-phishing", "AI-powered phishing and scams", ["ai phishing", "ai powered phishing", "ai scams", "ai generated scam", "chatgpt phishing", "ai generated phishing"], "social", "chatbot writing a message", {"fr": "Hameçonnage et arnaques assistés par IA", "sw": "Hadaa na ulaghai unaosaidiwa na AI", "rw": "Phishing n'uburiganya bukoresha AI"},
      ("Scammers use AI tools to write flawless, personalised messages in any language, copy a person's writing style, clone voices and create fake profiles and images at scale.", "Bad grammar is no longer a reliable clue. Judge by what is asked (money, codes, urgency, secrecy), verify through a separate trusted channel, and agree a family “safe word” for emergency calls."),
      ("Les escrocs utilisent des outils d'IA pour rédiger des messages impeccables et personnalisés dans toute langue, copier le style d'écriture, cloner des voix et créer à grande échelle de faux profils et images.", "Les fautes ne sont plus un indice fiable. Jugez ce qui est demandé (argent, codes, urgence, secret), vérifiez par un autre canal de confiance et convenez d'un « mot de sécurité » familial pour les appels d'urgence."),
      ("Abatekamutwe bakoresha ibikoresho bya AI mu kwandika ubutumwa butagira amakosa kandi bwihariye mu rurimi urwo ari rwo rwose, gukopera uburyo umuntu yandika, gukopera amajwi no gukora konti n'amashusho by'impimbano ku bwinshi.", "Amakosa y'ikibonezamvugo ntakiri ikimenyetso cyizewe. Reba icyo basaba (amafaranga, kode, kwihuta, ibanga), emeza unyuze ku yindi nzira yizewe kandi mu muryango mwemeranye «ijambo ry'umutekano» ry'ibyago."),
      ("Matapeli hutumia zana za AI kuandika ujumbe usio na makosa na wa kibinafsi kwa lugha yoyote, kunakili mtindo wa kuandika, kunakili sauti na kuunda wasifu na picha bandia kwa wingi.", "Sarufi mbaya si kidokezo cha kuaminika tena. Hukumu kwa kinachoombwa (pesa, misimbo, haraka, siri), thibitisha kupitia njia nyingine inayoaminika na kubaliana «neno la siri» la familia kwa simu za dharura.")),
    T("llm-security", "LLM and chatbot security", ["llm security", "chatbot security", "ai assistant security", "large language model security", "owasp llm", "ai security risks"], "appsec", "ai chatbot interface", {"fr": "Sécurité des LLM et chatbots", "sw": "Usalama wa LLM na chatbot", "rw": "Umutekano wa LLM na chatbot"},
      ("The risks of apps built on large language models: prompt injection, leaking secrets or private data, unsafe actions by connected tools, made-up answers (hallucinations) and over-trust.", "Treat model output as untrusted, give the AI only the minimum data and permissions, filter inputs and outputs, require human approval for risky actions and never put passwords or keys in prompts. See the OWASP Top 10 for LLM applications."),
      ("Les risques des applications construites sur de grands modèles de langage : injection de prompt, fuite de secrets ou de données privées, actions dangereuses via des outils connectés, réponses inventées (hallucinations) et excès de confiance.", "Traitez la sortie du modèle comme non fiable, donnez à l'IA le minimum de données et de droits, filtrez entrées et sorties, exigez une validation humaine pour les actions risquées et ne mettez jamais mots de passe ou clés dans les prompts. Voir l'OWASP Top 10 pour les applications LLM."),
      ("Ibyago bya porogaramu zubatswe kuri large language models: prompt injection, kumena ibanga cyangwa amakuru bwite, ibikorwa bibi bikozwe n'ibikoresho bihujwe, ibisubizo byahimbwe (hallucinations) no kwiringira birenze.", "Fata ibisohoka bya model nk'ibidafite ubwizerwe, uhe AI amakuru n'uburenganzira bikeya cyane, ushungure ibyinjira n'ibisohoka, usabe umuntu kwemeza ibikorwa bifite ibyago kandi ntuzigere ushyira amagambo y'ibanga cyangwa imfunguzo muri prompts. Reba OWASP Top 10 ya LLM."),
      ("Hatari za programu zilizojengwa juu ya large language models: prompt injection, kuvujisha siri au data binafsi, vitendo hatari vya zana zilizounganishwa, majibu ya kubuni (hallucinations) na kuamini kupita kiasi.", "Chukulia matokeo ya modeli kama yasiyoaminika, ipe AI data na ruhusa ndogo kabisa, chuja ingizo na matokeo, hitaji idhini ya binadamu kwa vitendo hatari na kamwe usiweke nywila au funguo kwenye prompts. Tazama OWASP Top 10 ya LLM.")),
    T("ai-jailbreak", "AI jailbreak", ["ai jailbreak", "jailbreak prompt", "llm jailbreak", "chatbot jailbreak", "dan prompt", "guardrail bypass"], "attacks", "chatbot safety limits", {"fr": "Jailbreak d'IA", "sw": "AI jailbreak", "rw": "AI jailbreak"},
      ("Crafting a prompt (role-play, hidden instructions, odd encodings) that gets an AI model to ignore its safety rules and produce content or actions it was designed to refuse.", "AI makers answer with better training, filters and monitoring, and testers use red teaming to find holes first. Users should know that tricking a model into harmful output can break service rules and the law."),
      ("Rédiger un prompt (jeu de rôle, instructions cachées, encodages étranges) qui pousse un modèle d'IA à ignorer ses règles de sécurité et à produire des contenus ou actions qu'il devait refuser.", "Les concepteurs répondent par un meilleur entraînement, des filtres et une surveillance, et les testeurs font du red teaming pour trouver d'abord les failles. Les utilisateurs doivent savoir que pousser un modèle vers du contenu nuisible peut enfreindre les règles du service et la loi."),
      ("Gukora prompt (gukina uruhare, amabwiriza ahishwe, encoding zidasanzwe) ituma model ya AI yirengagiza amategeko yayo y'umutekano igatanga ibyo yagombaga kwanga.", "Abakora AI basubiza bakoresheje amahugurwa meza, filters no gukurikirana, naho abagerageza bagakora red teaming kubona ibyuho mbere. Abakoresha bamenye ko gutuma model itanga ibibi bishobora kurenga amategeko ya serivisi n'amategeko y'igihugu."),
      ("Kuunda prompt (kuigiza jukumu, maagizo yaliyofichwa, usimbaji wa ajabu) inayofanya modeli ya AI kupuuza sheria zake za usalama na kutoa maudhui au vitendo ilivyoundwa kukataa.", "Waundaji wa AI hujibu kwa mafunzo bora, vichujio na ufuatiliaji, na wajaribu hufanya red teaming kupata mianya kwanza. Watumiaji wajue kudanganya modeli itoe maudhui hatari kunaweza kukiuka sheria za huduma na sheria za nchi.")),
    T("data-poisoning", "Data poisoning", ["data poisoning", "model poisoning", "training data poisoning", "backdoor in model", "poisoned dataset"], "attacks", "contaminated data", {"fr": "Empoisonnement de données", "sw": "Sumu ya data (data poisoning)", "rw": "Gutera ubumara amakuru (data poisoning)"},
      ("Deliberately inserting bad or misleading examples into the data an AI learns from, so that the model behaves wrongly or contains a hidden trigger.", "Defences: use trusted, checked data sources, track where data comes from, detect outliers, test models for unexpected behaviour and keep humans in the loop for important decisions."),
      ("Insérer délibérément des exemples faux ou trompeurs dans les données d'apprentissage d'une IA pour que le modèle se comporte mal ou contienne un déclencheur caché.", "Défenses : sources de données fiables et vérifiées, traçabilité de l'origine des données, détection des valeurs aberrantes, tests de comportements inattendus et humains dans la boucle pour les décisions importantes."),
      ("Gushyira ku bushake ingero mbi cyangwa ziyobya mu makuru AI yigiraho, kugira ngo model ikore nabi cyangwa ibe ifite ikimenyetso gihishe gikoresha ikibi.", "Kwirinda: gukoresha inkomoko z'amakuru zizewe kandi zagenzuwe, gukurikirana inkomoko y'amakuru, gutahura ibidasanzwe, kugerageza model ku myitwarire itateganyijwe no kugumisha abantu mu byemezo by'ingenzi."),
      ("Kuweka kwa makusudi mifano mibaya au ya kupotosha kwenye data ambazo AI hujifunza kutoka kwazo, ili modeli ifanye vibaya au iwe na kichocheo kilichofichwa.", "Ulinzi: tumia vyanzo vya data vilivyoaminika na kukaguliwa, fuatilia data zinatoka wapi, gundua zisizo za kawaida, jaribu modeli kwa tabia zisizotarajiwa na uweke binadamu kwenye maamuzi muhimu.")),
    T("adversarial-examples", "Adversarial examples", ["adversarial example", "adversarial examples", "adversarial attack", "adversarial machine learning", "fooling ai", "evasion attack"], "attacks", "image recognition fooled", {"fr": "Exemples adverses", "sw": "Mifano ya adversarial", "rw": "Adversarial examples"},
      ("Inputs altered in ways people barely notice (a few pixels, a sticker on a sign, inaudible noise) that make an AI system misclassify them, for example reading a stop sign as a speed-limit sign.", "Matters for cameras, face recognition, spam filters and self-driving systems. Defences: adversarial training, input checks, multiple sensors or models and human review for high-stakes uses."),
      ("Entrées modifiées de façon à peine perceptible (quelques pixels, un autocollant sur un panneau, bruit inaudible) qui font mal classer l'entrée par une IA, par exemple lire un panneau stop comme une limitation de vitesse.", "Important pour caméras, reconnaissance faciale, filtres antispam et systèmes de conduite autonome. Défenses : entraînement adverse, contrôles des entrées, plusieurs capteurs ou modèles et revue humaine pour les usages à enjeu."),
      ("Ibyinjijwe bihinduwe mu buryo abantu batabona (utudomo dukeya, sticker ku kimenyetso, urusaku rutumvikana) bituma sisitemu ya AI ibisobanura nabi, urugero gusoma ikimenyetso cya stop nk'icy'umuvuduko.", "Bifite akamaro kuri kamera, kumenya isura, spam filters na sisitemu zitwara imodoka. Kwirinda: adversarial training, kugenzura ibyinjijwe, sensors cyangwa models nyinshi n'isuzuma ry'abantu ku bikorwa by'ingenzi."),
      ("Ingizo zilizobadilishwa kwa njia ambazo watu hawazioni (pikseli chache, kibandiko kwenye alama, kelele isiyosikika) zinazofanya mfumo wa AI kuvitafsiri vibaya, mfano kusoma alama ya stop kama kikomo cha kasi.", "Ni muhimu kwa kamera, utambuzi wa uso, vichujio vya spam na mifumo ya kujiendesha. Ulinzi: mafunzo ya adversarial, ukaguzi wa ingizo, vihisi au modeli nyingi na ukaguzi wa binadamu kwa matumizi muhimu.")),
    T("model-extraction-inference", "Model extraction and membership inference", ["model extraction", "model stealing", "membership inference", "model inversion", "training data extraction", "privacy attacks on ai"], "privacy", "ai model privacy", {"fr": "Extraction de modèle et inférence d'appartenance", "sw": "Kuiba modeli na membership inference", "rw": "Kwiba model na membership inference"},
      ("Attacks on AI services: model extraction copies a model by querying it many times; membership inference and model inversion try to tell whether a person's data was used in training or to reconstruct private training data.", "Defences: rate limits and monitoring of queries, not training on unnecessary personal data, techniques like differential privacy, and removing sensitive information from data before training."),
      ("Attaques contre les services d'IA : l'extraction de modèle copie un modèle en l'interrogeant massivement ; l'inférence d'appartenance et l'inversion de modèle cherchent à savoir si les données d'une personne ont servi à l'entraînement ou à reconstruire des données privées.", "Défenses : limitation et surveillance des requêtes, ne pas entraîner sur des données personnelles inutiles, techniques comme la confidentialité différentielle, et retrait des informations sensibles avant l'entraînement."),
      ("Ibitero ku serivisi za AI: model extraction ikoporora model mu kuyibaza kenshi; membership inference na model inversion bigerageza kumenya niba amakuru y'umuntu yarakoreshejwe mu kwigisha cyangwa kongera kubaka amakuru bwite.", "Kwirinda: kugabanya no gukurikirana ibibazo, kutigisha amakuru bwite adakenewe, uburyo nka differential privacy no gukura amakuru y'ibanga mbere yo kwigisha."),
      ("Mashambulizi dhidi ya huduma za AI: model extraction hunakili modeli kwa kuiuliza mara nyingi; membership inference na model inversion hujaribu kujua kama data ya mtu ilitumika kufunza au kujenga upya data binafsi.", "Ulinzi: vikomo na ufuatiliaji wa maswali, kutofunza kwa data binafsi zisizo za lazima, mbinu kama differential privacy na kuondoa taarifa nyeti kabla ya mafunzo.")),
    T("shadow-ai", "Shadow AI and data leakage to AI tools", ["shadow ai", "ai data leakage", "pasting confidential data into chatgpt", "unapproved ai tools", "ai usage policy"], "governance", "employee using chatbot", {"fr": "IA fantôme (shadow AI)", "sw": "Shadow AI", "rw": "Shadow AI"},
      ("When people use unapproved AI tools at work and paste in confidential text, code or customer data, which can then be stored, reviewed or used by the tool's provider.", "Organisations should publish an AI-use policy, provide approved tools with proper data terms and train staff. Individuals: never paste passwords, personal data of others, medical or financial details or company secrets into public chatbots."),
      ("Quand des employés utilisent des outils d'IA non approuvés et y collent du texte, du code ou des données clients confidentiels, qui peuvent ensuite être stockés, relus ou exploités par le fournisseur de l'outil.", "Les organisations doivent publier une politique d'usage de l'IA, fournir des outils approuvés aux conditions de données adaptées et former le personnel. Individuellement : ne collez jamais mots de passe, données personnelles d'autrui, informations médicales ou financières ni secrets d'entreprise dans des chatbots publics."),
      ("Iyo abantu bakoresha ibikoresho bya AI bitemewe ku kazi bagashyiramo inyandiko, code cyangwa amakuru y'abakiriya y'ibanga, ashobora kubikwa, gusomwa cyangwa gukoreshwa n'utanga icyo gikoresho.", "Ibigo bigomba gushyiraho politiki yo gukoresha AI, gutanga ibikoresho byemewe bifite amasezerano meza y'amakuru no guhugura abakozi. Umuntu ku giti cye: ntuzigere ushyira amagambo y'ibanga, amakuru bwite y'abandi, ay'ubuvuzi cyangwa imari cyangwa ibanga ry'ikigo muri chatbots rusange."),
      ("Wakati watu wanapotumia zana za AI zisizoidhinishwa kazini na kubandika maandishi, msimbo au data za wateja za siri, ambazo zinaweza kuhifadhiwa, kusomwa au kutumiwa na mtoa zana.", "Mashirika yachapishe sera ya matumizi ya AI, yatoe zana zilizoidhinishwa zenye masharti sahihi ya data na kuwafunza wafanyakazi. Mtu binafsi: kamwe usibandike nywila, data binafsi za wengine, taarifa za afya au fedha wala siri za kampuni kwenye chatbots za umma.")),
    T("deepfake-detection-provenance", "Deepfake detection and content provenance", ["deepfake detection", "content provenance", "c2pa", "watermarking", "synthetic media detection", "content credentials", "how to spot a deepfake"], "defense", "authenticity label on image", {"fr": "Détection de deepfakes et provenance du contenu", "sw": "Kugundua deepfake na asili ya maudhui", "rw": "Gutahura deepfake n'inkomoko y'ibikubiyemo"},
      ("Methods to judge whether media is real: looking for visual and audio glitches, checking the source, and technical tools such as watermarks and signed “content credentials” (C2PA) that record how a file was made and edited.", "No detector is perfect and fakes improve. Pause on shocking clips, search for the original source, check whether trusted outlets confirm it, and be extra careful with urgent voice or video requests for money."),
      ("Méthodes pour juger si un média est authentique : chercher des défauts visuels et sonores, vérifier la source et utiliser des outils comme les filigranes et les « content credentials » signés (C2PA) qui enregistrent comment un fichier a été créé et modifié.", "Aucun détecteur n'est parfait et les faux s'améliorent. Marquez une pause devant les vidéos choquantes, cherchez la source d'origine, vérifiez si des médias fiables confirment et soyez très prudent face aux demandes urgentes d'argent par voix ou vidéo."),
      ("Uburyo bwo gusuzuma niba itangazamakuru ari ukuri: gushaka amakosa mu mashusho n'amajwi, kugenzura inkomoko no gukoresha ibikoresho nka watermarks na «content credentials» (C2PA) byandika uko dosiye yakozwe n'uko yahinduwe.", "Nta gikoresho gitahura byose kandi ibihimbano biranonosoka. Hagarara imbere ya videwo zitangaje, shakisha inkomoko y'ibanze, reba niba ibitangazamakuru byizewe byemeza kandi witondere cyane ibyifuzo byihutirwa by'amafaranga mu majwi cyangwa videwo."),
      ("Njia za kuhukumu kama media ni halisi: kutafuta hitilafu za picha na sauti, kukagua chanzo na zana kama alama za maji na «content credentials» zilizosainiwa (C2PA) zinazorekodi faili ilivyotengenezwa na kuhaririwa.", "Hakuna kigunduzi kamili na bandia zinaboreka. Simama kwenye klipu za kushtua, tafuta chanzo asili, angalia kama vyombo vya habari vinavyoaminika vinathibitisha, na uwe makini zaidi na maombi ya haraka ya pesa kwa sauti au video.")),
    T("ai-agent-hijacking", "AI agent hijacking", ["ai agent hijacking", "agent hijacking", "ai agent security", "agentic ai security", "tool poisoning", "indirect prompt injection"], "attacks", "ai agent with tools", {"fr": "Détournement d'agents IA", "sw": "Kuteka mawakala wa AI", "rw": "Gutwara agents za AI"},
      ("When an AI agent that can browse, read email or use tools is manipulated through hidden instructions in a web page, document or message (indirect prompt injection), so it leaks data or takes actions its owner never intended.", "Defences: give agents least privilege, separate untrusted content from instructions, require confirmation for sending, paying or deleting, log every action and do not let agents handle secrets they do not need."),
      ("Quand un agent IA capable de naviguer, lire des e-mails ou utiliser des outils est manipulé par des instructions cachées dans une page web, un document ou un message (injection de prompt indirecte), au point de fuiter des données ou d'agir contre la volonté de son propriétaire.", "Défenses : donner aux agents le moindre privilège, séparer contenu non fiable et instructions, exiger confirmation pour envoyer, payer ou supprimer, journaliser chaque action et ne pas leur confier de secrets inutiles."),
      ("Iyo agent ya AI ishobora gusoma imbuga, imeri cyangwa gukoresha ibikoresho ikoreshejwe n'amabwiriza ahishe mu rupapuro rwa web, inyandiko cyangwa ubutumwa (indirect prompt injection), igatuma imena amakuru cyangwa igakora ibyo nyirayo atashakaga.", "Kwirinda: guha agents uburenganzira bukeya, gutandukanya ibitizewe n'amabwiriza, gusaba kwemeza mbere yo kohereza, kwishyura cyangwa gusiba, kwandika buri gikorwa no kutabaha ibanga badakeneye."),
      ("Wakati wakala wa AI anayeweza kuvinjari, kusoma barua pepe au kutumia zana anapodanganywa kwa maagizo yaliyofichwa kwenye ukurasa wa wavuti, hati au ujumbe (indirect prompt injection), hadi kuvujisha data au kutenda asichotaka mmiliki.", "Ulinzi: wapa mawakala haki ndogo kabisa, tenganisha maudhui yasiyoaminika na maagizo, hitaji uthibitisho kabla ya kutuma, kulipa au kufuta, rekodi kila kitendo na usiwaachie siri wasizozihitaji.")),
    T("ai-red-teaming", "AI red teaming", ["ai red teaming", "red teaming ai", "model red team", "ai safety testing", "ai penetration testing"], "operations", "testing an ai system", {"fr": "Red teaming d'IA", "sw": "AI red teaming", "rw": "AI red teaming"},
      ("Structured testing where specialists try to make an AI system fail or misbehave (jailbreaks, bias, leaks, unsafe advice, misuse) before attackers or users find the problems.", "Findings are used to improve training, filters and policies. Good practice: test regularly, include diverse testers and languages (including Kinyarwanda and Kiswahili), fix and re-test, and document limits honestly."),
      ("Tests structurés où des spécialistes tentent de faire échouer ou dérailler un système d'IA (jailbreaks, biais, fuites, conseils dangereux, usages détournés) avant que des attaquants ou utilisateurs ne trouvent les problèmes.", "Les résultats servent à améliorer l'entraînement, les filtres et les politiques. Bonne pratique : tester régulièrement, inclure des testeurs et langues variés (dont le kinyarwanda et le kiswahili), corriger puis retester, et documenter honnêtement les limites."),
      ("Igeragezwa riteguye aho abahanga bagerageza gutuma sisitemu ya AI inanirwa cyangwa ikora nabi (jailbreaks, ubuhezanguni, kumena amakuru, inama mbi, gukoreshwa nabi) mbere y'uko abashimusi cyangwa abakoresha babona ibibazo.", "Ibivuyemo bikoreshwa mu kunoza amahugurwa, filters na politiki. Imikorere myiza: kugerageza buri gihe, gushyiramo abagerageza n'indimi zitandukanye (harimo Ikinyarwanda n'Igiswahili), gukosora no kongera kugerageza no kwandika imbibi z'ukuri."),
      ("Majaribio yaliyopangwa ambapo wataalamu hujaribu kufanya mfumo wa AI ushindwe au ukose (jailbreak, upendeleo, uvujaji, ushauri hatari, matumizi mabaya) kabla ya washambuliaji au watumiaji kupata matatizo.", "Matokeo hutumika kuboresha mafunzo, vichujio na sera. Mazoea mazuri: jaribu mara kwa mara, jumuisha wajaribu na lugha mbalimbali (pamoja na Kinyarwanda na Kiswahili), rekebisha na jaribu tena, na andika mipaka kwa uaminifu.")),
]
